<p>(c) Includes $148,000 and $974,000 less interest and dividend income in Q4 and 52 weeks 1996, compared with 1995. Also includes realized gains on sale of marketable securities of $106,000 in Q4 1996 vs gains of $328,000 in Q4 1995.</p>
<p>(d) Costs, net of tax, from arbitration of disputed items in 1993 sale of communication equipment business.</p>
